Z||000006||Monkeyman||06-15-2001||03:36 AM||||It was suggested to me that you can wear a bra without damaging your front fascia by heavily waxing it with good old paste wax and <B>not</B> buffing it out.  Also remove the bra once a month and give it a good washing, then rewax and reinstall the bra.<P>fropuff--If BVMotorsports isn't interested in your bra, I might be.  If he backs out, shoot me an email and LMK.<P>MM||||reg||1
